<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/statement-immutability> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/statement-immutability/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/statement-immutability> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/DefinedTerm> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/statement-immutability/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/statement-immutability> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The xAPI principle that key semantic parts of a Statement are not changed after the Statement has been stored. The standard identifies specific properties that are immutable and others that may differ without changing the Statement’s essential meaning." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/statement-immutability/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/statement-immutability> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://id.i2idl.org/scheme> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/statement-immutability/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/statement-immutability> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Statement immutability" <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/statement-immutability/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/statement-immutability> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/xapi-statement> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/statement-immutability/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/statement-immutability> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/activeDefinition> <https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/statement-immutability-1> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/statement-immutability/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/statement-immutability> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "Immutability allows Statements to be shared between LRSs while preserving the evidence they represent and reduces ambiguity about whether two copies describe the same event." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/statement-immutability/versions/1> .
